            <div xml:id="m-a74d7e00-0285-4105-9261-9dd6a67a5825">
              <lg xml:id="m-6f39be14-a2d1-4cb9-ac20-10c8cd283d30">
                <l xml:id="m-3fb7baf9-fe4a-49bd-b4e9-c58978164a2e" facs="#m-3636d84c-c249-46f3-aa1c-2e281b818c30" label="text-like">Ist Sunday of Advent.</l><l xml:id="m-7901d1d2-b419-453f-ae90-5e20ed3af998" facs="#m-79eda6c1-c747-4413-8711-2328d27c6cc6" label="ambiguous">321</l><l xml:id="m-d9eefe86-8c1d-4c40-8068-5826d5a6d21a" facs="#m-3705981d-cdf0-4e16-9a02-1db16b363716" label="lyrics-like">di-am tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-876cff4b-e931-41f5-8297-4362cfb8b1bb" facs="#m-24e087f1-10e5-43bc-a614-fb4f3be7cea3" label="lyrics-like">am: et sa-lu-tá-re tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-178d216d-b892-4734-b74c-129973525dda" facs="#m-82d1520a-e80b-4ef8-b6c4-63d867b594db" label="text-like">The Choir.</l><l xml:id="m-6cd9db95-d25e-4d3f-a9dd-e20d8a87a4c3" facs="#m-052301f8-8266-44e5-a509-fb26f85d5d3c" label="lyrics-like">um da nó¬ bis.</l><l xml:id="m-ac4e839f-6c32-4a65-b8f5-cc596e3bdfe7" facs="#m-c349d6a0-f29e-400d-bea3-a42fe32c42d9" label="text-like">The Cantors.</l><l xml:id="m-a30bf06e-1c90-44c3-8874-cc04ef83f171" facs="#m-ca55e732-ffce-4a27-b585-5285822a5e9f" label="ambiguous">Alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-f6ed073c-928d-4df5-8685-9e75f7704c10" facs="#m-9c09a74b-e084-47a0-b088-2fcffd54a9b7" label="text-like">The Choin.</l><l xml:id="m-1e9d0880-2dba-4e9e-b188-4a82a77f6dae" facs="#m-edf7c31c-2d13-4d10-8ab2-f76aa6a94949" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia.</l><l xml:id="m-f3f6b1f9-763b-4c95-8d87-42f8e849b8ba" facs="#m-33a8d508-ecff-4288-ad44-359e96925125" label="lyrics-like">The Allelúia is sung thus throughout the year unless the contrary be</l><l xml:id="m-19db70c3-f773-4acd-9400-f3864995f297" facs="#m-7855a7d8-fe30-4545-86ca-84a44d8a7f75" label="ambiguous">indicated.</l><l xml:id="m-e39ed80a-fa3a-4725-9329-b9b139908669" facs="#m-e5c26338-3d83-4c40-9b72-eed3eec004cb" label="ambiguous">Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Lucam. Luc. 27. c.</l><l xml:id="m-ce8ec433-80da-48ed-b305-983ee3df741e" facs="#m-de2489df-cbd7-4804-ac58-868fa5744b80" label="lyrics-like">(N illo témpore : Dixit Jesus discí- et levâte cápita vestra: quóniam</l><l xml:id="m-2f643632-fa03-4938-a6ac-9f626faf8e34" facs="#m-41984dea-c08a-42dd-87c4-48e84d041823" label="ambiguous">A pulis suis: Erunt signa in sole,</l><l xml:id="m-80e0d2b1-c2f9-4d97-a4c7-55bbe42d0a99" facs="#m-6c6b25d1-b8f0-4b74-af26-fcb91a84cf34" label="lyrics-like">appropínquat redémptio vestra. Et</l><l xml:id="m-eba602ef-3690-4e9d-8f9d-06ea4a892b38" facs="#m-cffb870b-aa08-4aab-89ef-6dd9d9e9f4b5" label="lyrics-like">dixit illis similitúdinem: Vidéte</l><l xml:id="m-50191d08-a8dd-4c6c-9e8f-8070258c1c2b" facs="#m-6a46bf66-38e7-43ad-9969-6ce9c02f7c6d" label="ambiguous">et luna, et stellis, et in terris pres¬</l><l xml:id="m-30be5fcd-b915-4f40-8145-6ef71e41bed9" facs="#m-c41da540-b44d-4fe8-926f-9c7fd36d9d7b" label="lyrics-like">súra géntium prae confusióne sóni¬</l><l xml:id="m-cda05f58-f98d-4310-9be5-454427c9e140" facs="#m-d41b4043-9d32-404c-9f95-cc822f0e712a" label="lyrics-like">ficúlneam, et omnes árbores: cum</l><l xml:id="m-8504129a-65dc-4e0b-a215-340027f82322" facs="#m-86b362a2-e5b0-499b-9e95-6dbfc1ac53b7" label="lyrics-like">prodúcunt jam ex se fructum, scitis</l><l xml:id="m-8a40b7f7-3d75-49af-b24f-4ecc9c64114b" facs="#m-54d4b2fd-9eaa-409b-be84-1863ade0708b" label="lyrics-like">tus maris, et flúctuum: arescéntibus</l><l xml:id="m-cabd2c51-33e8-4d34-914c-b579c8b78af4" facs="#m-e42523ff-4c65-47a8-837e-037a94b18088" label="lyrics-like">quóniam prope est aestas. Ita et vos</l><l xml:id="m-43f8e406-b1b5-4df1-8ca9-71db0987d51f" facs="#m-5937d27c-f6d9-4f6e-9773-b8802d5bf1bf" label="lyrics-like">hominibus prae-timóre et exspecta¬</l><l xml:id="m-753f7d10-ce3e-46b7-aa50-dcbff8673705" facs="#m-1881171e-100b-43be-b377-c58ca51460f9" label="lyrics-like">cum vidéritis haec fieri, scitóte quó¬</l><l xml:id="m-22f0870c-1b46-47e1-85fa-b038f7a7a8dc" facs="#m-a1b3dc57-7c3b-4bf6-83fd-7d9cd6f47bae" label="lyrics-like">tióne, quae supervénient univérso</l><l xml:id="m-278438b3-a62c-49fb-bdb9-b91718fa57e5" facs="#m-efbcc6ef-294f-48f1-9b9a-58b1a5807e9f" label="ambiguous">niam prope est regnum Dei. Amen</l><l xml:id="m-16bef848-1393-4f25-b92b-d0289ed14f3f" facs="#m-20ac289c-605c-4ea7-a9b4-bcc19b24d30f" label="lyrics-like">orbi: nam virtútes caelórum move¬</l><l xml:id="m-d7a79eeb-442a-4f27-b46e-3ec34eaca8b7" facs="#m-95ebbc30-1545-4ac8-84d7-0ac9c55565b9" label="ambiguous">dico vobis, quia non praetersbit ge¬</l><l xml:id="m-76cd6c37-1c11-465e-a98d-9d9cbade1fe7" facs="#m-490be6b4-081a-4dac-be77-618eec3c3905" label="lyrics-like">búntur. Et tunc vidébunt Filium</l><l xml:id="m-a20d557d-ee07-4422-a832-d4147b912e1e" facs="#m-c8fe76a2-b923-43f1-9767-b4a7dbf31cd8" label="lyrics-like">nerátio haec, donec ómnia fiant.</l><l xml:id="m-51c90525-7bff-47c5-9f3a-66fb787c6fe1" facs="#m-08089df3-8b58-4d68-9354-56b559ef1646" label="lyrics-like">hóminis veniéntem in nube cum</l><l xml:id="m-990040f1-c6d3-48bd-ac3a-0e7042fa5815" facs="#m-2963b83c-6e3e-4962-9caa-72068a3d22ce" label="ambiguous">Caelum et terra transibunt : verba</l><l xml:id="m-63a25d5a-ff34-41b3-85d8-d266836c52bf" facs="#m-56eadadd-0f7d-4ae1-89f6-4a01a49fa408" label="lyrics-like">potestáte magna, et majestáte. His</l><l xml:id="m-f1e4afdb-a500-4d3d-8d27-fec06c0dc591" facs="#m-3c09b844-f466-48f2-88f9-6c7ff233e090" label="lyrics-like">autem fieri incipiéntibus, respicite, autem mea non transibunt.</l><l xml:id="m-f1becac9-3f29-4dcc-b997-cd0565a17163" facs="#m-b3d92753-852b-445f-9118-fd37ab320b7f" label="text-like">The Credo is said.</l><l xml:id="m-ad230b6b-aaf1-4021-ae38-11db75a63849" facs="#m-26b71f3c-711d-433b-b730-f8fada3566ae" label="text-like">The Cantors.</l><l xml:id="m-110ce72a-8d09-48d5-a01c-13c2f82ce81a" facs="#m-5fdf3f91-dd8d-4296-9f0e-4d87513a5e6b" label="ambiguous">Tue-Choir.</l><l xml:id="m-1715ee04-0a1d-4c48-ba79-ad2fb9048294" facs="#m-ae561ab8-117f-496e-8b3c-34113a30e7d1" label="ambiguous">offert.</l><l xml:id="m-70445547-19e4-4e17-8279-1ad4e0487c0e" facs="#m-aad38c1b-8bdb-442f-840d-6a04f8ff2a40" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-7d61244d-0184-4f65-aae2-5c748027671e" facs="#m-56042b51-4e93-4599-945c-18dd2720788a" label="ambiguous">A D te</l><l xml:id="m-b2999f28-730e-4000-bbe1-c2f4ccb7ab77" facs="#m-3048e8e1-22b8-4dc0-aa1b-468a2a0058f6" label="ambiguous">ni¬</l><l xml:id="m-d30dccdf-1ed7-4c0d-830d-508c6a322d71" facs="#m-22214585-32fc-4eb2-bbfc-17e20ce5d93e" label="lyrics-like">Dómi- ne “le- vá-vi á¬</l><l xml:id="m-ec776851-ad7a-4f4c-aae7-794cbb22f1ee" facs="#m-cf2765ac-d636-46eb-b4c6-4d963ffeb9ee" label="lyrics-like">mam mé. am: Dé-us mé- us, in te confi-do, non</l><l xml:id="m-3c7f945d-0d74-4e8b-b992-3c75b16d34d3" facs="#m-d3df83d3-3c65-41ae-a4a8-3ab9cda265e4" label="lyrics-like">inimí-ci</l><l xml:id="m-f148718a-57e4-4a91-a3c8-22172eace23d" facs="#m-7e963cef-e682-48f1-b7cb-4e808337d301" label="lyrics-like">eru- béscam: neque ir- ri-de¬</l><l xml:id="m-f8b51b84-0fa6-4ad1-ae78-26c492ab5e26" facs="#m-5af8f67b-94fd-4c45-b186-408dd3abe881" label="ambiguous">ant me</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
